WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:05.990
Translation: Henna | Typesetting: lucielnight
Timing: anon | Encoding: kuroyuki

00:03.130 --> 00:04.700
It's getting dark, huh.

00:06.530 --> 00:07.350
Yeah...

00:09.000 --> 00:12.910
I ended up staying up all night with another man.

00:13.960 --> 00:17.830
Normally I'd think nothing special of
simply being under the same roof.

00:18.220 --> 00:19.750
But now...

00:20.770 --> 00:24.410
[ izu presents]

00:20.770 --> 00:24.410
Hey, Class President!

00:21.370 --> 00:24.410
Chapter 2 - I spent the night with... the class president.

00:29.570 --> 00:30.560
Damn it...

00:31.570 --> 00:34.480
Who was it? I won't forgive them!

00:36.270 --> 00:38.560
Who the hell did this to him?!

00:45.700 --> 00:48.780
That was just my own fault for being careless.

00:48.940 --> 00:51.490
Besides, I'm a guy... I'm fine.

00:51.610 --> 00:54.330
You know, it's okay to be scared.

00:54.790 --> 00:59.480
More importantly, I'm the one who let you go home
alone, even though I knew you're so scatterbrained.

01:01.310 --> 01:02.750
I can't forgive myself!

01:03.920 --> 01:08.300
I promise I'll find that scumbag and kick his ass!

01:17.520 --> 01:21.440
Oh yeah, it was the captain who told
me something was wrong with you.

01:21.740 --> 01:24.570
Er, oh yeah, right. I'd been on the phone with Akutsu.

01:25.180 --> 01:29.570
Chiga, there are some footprints in the garden,
like someone was dragging their shoes.

01:29.990 --> 01:31.240
And leaves from the plants are strewn on the ground.

01:32.010 --> 01:33.910
Anyway, let's go around and lock all the doors and windows first.

01:36.660 --> 01:37.870
Yeah...

01:39.350 --> 01:41.870
Kokusai, mind if I come in through here?

01:42.000 --> 01:42.920
Uh, sure...

01:43.090 --> 01:44.600
You really like to do things your own way, don't you?

01:48.010 --> 01:51.310
Well, let's start by locking up downstairs.

01:54.480 --> 01:55.520
Damn it...

01:56.740 --> 01:58.980
Why wasn't I the one to notice it first?

02:00.000 --> 02:03.060
Idiot! Why am I even thinking about this stupid shit?

02:03.480 --> 02:06.860
Right now, I need to consider Kokusai-san first and foremost!

02:07.440 --> 02:08.220
Chiga...

02:09.410 --> 02:13.780
Just for peace of mind, let's all check together at the end.

02:15.570 --> 02:18.040
After all, I might be the one who attacked Kokusai.

02:19.080 --> 02:21.420
And you're suspecting me, aren't you?

02:22.130 --> 02:23.750
No, it's not like that.

02:24.090 --> 02:26.530
This is something even more ridiculous... Jealousy.

02:26.570 --> 02:28.840
However, it's equally likely that you attacked Kokusai.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.700
Well then, I'll leave the locking up here to you.

02:39.890 --> 02:40.850
Kokusai-san?

02:41.920 --> 02:43.660
Are your legs shaking?

02:44.110 --> 02:46.280
Uh... no, it's not that...

02:46.610 --> 02:48.990
I, um... got an erection...

02:50.000 --> 02:50.490
Erect...

02:51.530 --> 02:53.670
HE FELT YOU UP UNTIL YOU GOT HARD?!

02:55.480 --> 02:56.790
No, no!

02:56.870 --> 02:59.090
He only touched me a little bit!

02:59.180 --> 03:03.540
It's just um, in my dream, it was a cute girl touching me, so...

03:03.880 --> 03:04.500
Huh?

03:04.790 --> 03:07.250
Hold up. Kokusai-san dreams about girls?

03:07.920 --> 03:08.710
I can't tell him...

03:09.000 --> 03:11.260
I can't tell him I was dreaming of Chiga's hands all over me..

03:11.680 --> 03:12.570
I can't tell him!

03:12.800 --> 03:16.260
Well, it may not be comfortable, but let's get going.

03:17.960 --> 03:18.930
I locked up everything downstairs.

03:21.000 --> 03:24.650
One more thing, Kokusai - this was in the mailbox.

03:25.980 --> 03:26.730
Keys?

03:27.690 --> 03:31.820
Wait a second. Kokusai-san, you were
putting your keys in the mailbox?!

03:32.150 --> 03:34.570
Yeah, or else Grandma loses them.

03:34.870 --> 03:39.950
Listen, Kokusai-san, that's very dangerous.
You've got to put your keys somewhere else.

03:40.220 --> 03:43.500
You can tell your grandma that there's been a burglary
in the neighborhood recently or something.

03:43.740 --> 03:45.610
Oh, okay...

03:46.610 --> 03:49.590
Got it? Please make sure you talk to her.

03:50.790 --> 03:53.300
I'm... going crazy with worry over here.

03:54.130 --> 03:56.890
Oh, su-sure.... thank you.

03:57.300 --> 03:58.930
W-What're you blushing for?!

03:59.080 --> 04:00.530
W-Well, you too!

04:00.720 --> 04:04.850
I-I was just thinking that, you know,
you're actually a really nice guy.

04:05.050 --> 04:07.940
I mean, you hugged me before...

04:08.180 --> 04:10.650
Er, I guess that's kind of a strange thing to thank him for.

04:10.830 --> 04:14.360
Times like that are a little embarrassing,
but it feels really reassuring to be held.

04:17.310 --> 04:18.990
It's just a habit.

04:19.450 --> 04:22.330
It's no big deal, so you don't have to get all self-conscious.

04:23.220 --> 04:24.920
Self-conscious?!

04:25.540 --> 04:30.000
S-So you flirt with girls so much that it's a habit..?

04:30.960 --> 04:33.760
Sounds to me like you're jealous.

04:42.980 --> 04:47.610
Well, I'm still thankful, even if all you do is hurl insults back at me.

04:48.270 --> 04:50.820
Save your thanks for the captain.

04:54.530 --> 04:56.320
Quit being shy.

05:01.790 --> 05:03.790
It's this part of his personality...

05:06.330 --> 05:09.050
that's saved me so many times.

05:09.960 --> 05:12.840
I don't know how to speak to people any other way,

05:13.210 --> 05:18.050
so when I get into arguments, I apparently come
off to other people as being unwilling to listen.

05:19.050 --> 05:20.470
I'm not unaware of it.

05:21.740 --> 05:24.520
I'm stubborn, and not good at opening up honestly.

05:25.230 --> 05:27.790
That's why I don't normally get along
well with most upperclassmen.

05:27.900 --> 05:29.310
And I'm fairly unsociable.

05:30.640 --> 05:34.070
Back when I first joined the club, I had
an argument with Kokusai-san...

05:36.030 --> 05:39.950
Chiga, you have some great things to say.

05:40.410 --> 05:42.330
Don't ruin it by trying to talk the other person down.

05:43.230 --> 05:45.620
What, did I say something incorrect?

05:46.480 --> 05:49.420
No. But it was very cold.

05:52.000 --> 05:52.880
See you.

05:56.530 --> 05:58.590
I thought it was over with Kokusai-san, too.

05:59.130 --> 06:01.930
'It's always like this, there's nothing I can do,' I thought.

06:02.920 --> 06:03.850
But then...

06:04.830 --> 06:05.520
Chiga!

06:05.970 --> 06:07.930
Okay, let's keep going where we left off.

06:10.660 --> 06:13.730
Huh, Chiga, you're leaving already?

06:14.270 --> 06:17.150
Then um, sorry, but could you stick around with me for a bit?

06:20.280 --> 06:22.070
A-All right.

06:22.660 --> 06:24.790
Thanks.

06:25.180 --> 06:27.660
And yeah, sorry about before.

06:28.040 --> 06:29.620
I've cooled down now.

06:30.350 --> 06:32.290
No, it was my bad.

06:32.790 --> 06:34.170
I'm actually apologizing...

06:36.180 --> 06:41.340
It's just, you were right about me, and that pissed me off..

06:41.530 --> 06:45.100
No, it was me, too. I talked back very rudely.

06:45.640 --> 06:47.100
I can be honest and open about myself.

06:47.440 --> 06:49.230
It was because he started it first, but...

06:49.690 --> 06:50.560
I was able to say it.

06:52.260 --> 06:56.190
W-W-What's wrong?! Is it my fault?!

06:56.690 --> 06:58.990
No. I'm just grateful.

06:59.940 --> 07:02.740
I'm so glad I didn't lose him...

07:07.620 --> 07:14.540
I can't even describe how much that personality
of his did for me back then.

07:16.380 --> 07:21.010
Our conversation might have been
nothing special to Kokusai-san...

07:21.940 --> 07:22.590
What is it?

07:23.000 --> 07:24.760
But he saved me.

07:26.100 --> 07:29.430
My feelings back then were different from this emotion now,

07:30.180 --> 07:34.270
but right now, I'm beginning to fall for Kokusai-san all over again.

07:34.920 --> 07:35.610
I'm so glad!

07:38.110 --> 07:40.110
W-What?

07:40.780 --> 07:41.860
Nothing much.

07:43.200 --> 07:46.990
I was just remembering when I first joined the club.

07:48.870 --> 07:54.170
You used to be really adorable when you were
younger, like you were in my dream just now.

07:54.960 --> 07:56.670
So you're saying I'm not cute now?

07:59.570 --> 08:06.490
You were really pervy just now. In my dream,
you were touching me in all kinds of pervy ways.

08:06.490 --> 08:08.310
W-What, me?!

08:08.760 --> 08:11.020
That's why I got hard!

08:11.960 --> 08:14.100
Huh? But you just said it was a girl...

08:15.350 --> 08:16.270
I'm a huge idiot...

08:21.690 --> 08:24.200
Ko-Kokusai-san...

08:25.320 --> 08:27.000
Telephone's ringing.

08:29.830 --> 08:31.660
I'll go get it.

08:33.580 --> 08:35.530
Shall we go too?

08:36.080 --> 08:37.710
Yeah...

08:39.130 --> 08:44.050
Kokusai, your grandmother said she's staying at your sister's place.

08:44.470 --> 08:46.740
What? You're joking, right?

08:48.130 --> 08:52.810
Do you think I'm... really wimpy or something?

08:53.480 --> 08:55.070
I already thought so anyway.

08:56.570 --> 08:58.690
But I'm worried about you, and that's another story.

08:59.150 --> 09:01.900
Should I stay here until your family comes back?

09:02.400 --> 09:04.740
That'd be great! Thank you so much!

09:05.090 --> 09:09.200
I'm... not that brave... even though
I'm a male junior in high school..

09:09.620 --> 09:11.580
I told you, I don't mind.

09:11.830 --> 09:13.410
You had something really scary happen to you.

09:13.750 --> 09:14.700
I'm sure the captain will also...

09:14.700 --> 09:15.460
I'm going home.

09:15.660 --> 09:16.440
Eh?

09:16.670 --> 09:20.130
It's my rule not to spoil him. I'm leaving him to you, Chiga.

09:20.500 --> 09:22.000
So I'm off.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.960
Remember to lock the door.

09:26.790 --> 09:31.560
How can he fuss over him so much, and
then just leave him behind so easily?!

09:31.740 --> 09:33.520
His rule is not to spoil me, huh...

09:38.130 --> 09:41.190
Chiga, is this tournament video okay?

09:41.520 --> 09:42.650
Yeah, sure...

09:43.030 --> 09:44.350
He's so close...

09:45.310 --> 09:48.570
Why am I so conscious of his presence now, after all this time?

09:48.610 --> 09:50.480
Why the hell am I so nervous?

09:51.530 --> 09:53.000
I KNOW! The room's too dark!

09:53.120 --> 09:54.700
SWITCH ON THE LIGHTS!

09:54.700 --> 09:55.790
Ri-Right!

09:57.210 --> 09:59.880
Wow, it was a lot darker than I'd realized.

09:59.900 --> 10:01.710
Yeah, you're right.

10:08.610 --> 10:10.640
Well, let's watch the video.

10:11.640 --> 10:15.430
Kokusai-san is also really conscious of my presence...

10:16.530 --> 10:20.810
Wait, what am I saying? Too much wishful thinking...

10:21.310 --> 10:21.900
But...

10:22.090 --> 10:24.440
Kokusai-san, I'm closing the curtains, okay?

10:25.960 --> 10:28.780
Uh, sure, please.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.160
I'm going to try my luck.

10:30.400 --> 10:33.330
If he unnaturally insists I take the sofa...

10:37.180 --> 10:40.540
Uh, Chiga, don't you want to sit on the sofa?

10:42.000 --> 10:43.710
I can see better up close.

10:44.500 --> 10:45.960
Oh, okay...

10:49.630 --> 10:51.090
Is that... a problem?

10:51.510 --> 10:54.260
If he doesn't seriously hate it..

10:55.160 --> 10:58.700
Um... uh, so I'm gonna start this, okay?

10:59.940 --> 11:01.810
What's up with this atmosphere...?

11:02.090 --> 11:04.620
Why can't I just act normal?

11:09.650 --> 11:11.530
The tape's over here.

11:15.810 --> 11:19.410
Could I be any more obviously flustered?

11:21.870 --> 11:24.080
Huh? That's weird, it's not going in!

11:24.260 --> 11:25.310
Let me do it.

11:29.330 --> 11:31.050
I'm such an idiot...

11:42.440 --> 11:43.400
Are you afraid?

11:43.850 --> 11:46.150
No, I'm not ("chigakute"), Chiga...

11:46.400 --> 11:48.690
Hey, that was kind of like a pun!

11:50.190 --> 11:55.660
My mouth just happened to be open, so...

12:02.000 --> 12:03.620
A French kiss?!

12:08.550 --> 12:11.340
In... and out...

12:19.000 --> 12:19.770
Are you scared?

12:19.920 --> 12:21.270
Not really.

12:21.400 --> 12:24.260
What the hell do I mean, "not really"?!

12:24.440 --> 12:26.520
My heartbeat's going nuts!

12:27.980 --> 12:29.610
This is getting dangerous...

12:37.950 --> 12:39.740
...really dangerous.

12:40.740 --> 12:41.790
Kokusai-san.

12:42.570 --> 12:45.920
I'll turn all your feelings of fear into pleasure.

12:48.690 --> 12:50.210
I'm being so pushy...

12:55.720 --> 12:56.840
What was that?

12:57.220 --> 12:58.700
N-Nothing..

12:59.050 --> 12:59.930
I see.

13:10.520 --> 13:14.360
You know, if you feel embarrassed, you don't have to look at me.

13:14.590 --> 13:16.820
Wait, hold on a second!

13:18.570 --> 13:19.870
But you can't wait, can you?

13:22.790 --> 13:24.790
Chiga's scaring me!

13:29.700 --> 13:30.540
Scaring...?

13:31.440 --> 13:32.570
No, that's not right.

13:33.050 --> 13:34.050
Kokusai-san...

13:34.960 --> 13:37.930
His voice is resonating from the nape of my neck up to my ear...

13:38.640 --> 13:40.350
It feels like a chill.

13:45.480 --> 13:48.130
What am I acting all shy about, I'm a boy
in his second year of high school!

13:48.180 --> 13:53.150
I'll at least stand up and say it- I'm <i>turned</i> on!

13:56.100 --> 13:56.950
Kokusai-san...

13:59.600 --> 14:00.280
I'll never....

14:04.370 --> 14:06.450
let anyone else touch you again.

14:16.050 --> 14:17.720
Even you can get hard, huh?

14:18.470 --> 14:20.180
Of course I can!

14:20.470 --> 14:21.390
Are you scared?

14:22.550 --> 14:24.130
Uh... n-no, not really.

14:24.520 --> 14:28.140
Actually, I'm scared of myself for not even putting up a fight.

14:43.530 --> 14:44.790
Hey, you're laughing..!

14:44.970 --> 14:46.080
Kokusai-san...

14:46.180 --> 14:48.830
Let's make you unable to even utter a word.

15:04.660 --> 15:07.390
Chi-Chiga, wait...!

15:15.050 --> 15:16.730
I HATE THIS FRESHMAN!

15:18.260 --> 15:20.860
You don't need to hold your voice back.

15:27.540 --> 15:29.250
You're crying...?

15:29.870 --> 15:32.500
Because it feels so good...

15:33.750 --> 15:38.630
I see. I'm sorry I stopped.

15:39.090 --> 15:40.700
You haven't been satisfied yet, right?

15:40.740 --> 15:43.390
W-What are you....?! You stupid idiot!

15:44.600 --> 15:45.700
You're wet.

15:45.700 --> 15:47.640
D-Don't say it out loud!

15:49.040 --> 15:49.850
It's spilling out.

15:50.530 --> 15:51.230
Chiga...!

15:52.810 --> 15:53.830
That was quick.

15:54.830 --> 15:56.670
You big bully Chiga.

15:57.110 --> 15:58.280
Yup, I'm a big bully.

15:59.440 --> 16:00.320
What a jerk...

16:02.220 --> 16:07.330
Wait a second, why am I okay with Chiga touching me like this?

16:10.250 --> 16:14.460
Kokusai-san, I...

16:16.300 --> 16:17.880
You what...?

16:19.830 --> 16:20.550
...lov-

16:26.610 --> 16:27.350
Ignore it

16:27.890 --> 16:28.810
That's too bad...

16:30.790 --> 16:32.350
Huh? Why am I disappointed?

16:32.810 --> 16:33.800
Kokusai-san.

16:36.730 --> 16:38.220
You're home, aren't you?

16:38.730 --> 16:40.220
That would be Kondou.

16:40.480 --> 16:41.820
You, too, Chiga!

16:48.090 --> 16:49.490
Er, I, um...

16:55.090 --> 16:58.000
Tolerance level... exceeded.

17:00.220 --> 17:04.130
I never knew I could lose my self-control like that.

17:05.680 --> 17:07.760
Here, Kondou. Coffee.

17:08.660 --> 17:11.790
Ummm, could I please have the one in your left hand?

17:11.830 --> 17:13.410
Huh? What's the difference?

17:13.660 --> 17:18.920
Dude, your right hand's probably been touching
Kokusai-san's thing! Did you even wash your hands?!

17:19.700 --> 17:27.070
Er, don't worry about it. Anyway, I see you feel perfectly
at home inviting yourself to use Kokusai-san's kitchen.

17:27.870 --> 17:29.240
Why are you here?

17:29.660 --> 17:32.790
Well, um, I heard from the captain...

17:33.090 --> 17:35.720
that the two of you were getting it on, so I came to interrupt.

17:35.770 --> 17:40.670
I mean, if my friend and my senpai end up
hooking up, how am I supposed to act?!

17:41.480 --> 17:44.880
A molester came into Kokusai-san's house today.

17:45.050 --> 17:45.550
Huh?

17:45.830 --> 17:49.260
Wait, you're not just describing yourself?

17:49.800 --> 17:52.350
I want to be the one to protect Kokusai-san.

17:53.140 --> 18:01.570
But if I'm really thinking about what's best for him,
I know I should call the police or something.

18:02.260 --> 18:03.070
Chiga...

18:03.570 --> 18:06.400
I'm sorry, I made fun of you when you were serious...

18:06.920 --> 18:12.160
But I want him to depend on no one else but me,

18:12.700 --> 18:14.830
to be thankful to no one else but me.

18:16.830 --> 18:17.750
What should I do?

18:19.540 --> 18:21.630
I love Kokusai-san so much!

18:26.350 --> 18:28.880
I kind of... can't calm down...

18:31.220 --> 18:33.560
I can't get Chiga out of my mind...

18:39.260 --> 18:41.690
No! No! Don't think about it!

18:43.130 --> 18:45.900
And I won't ever, ever use Chiga to...

18:46.320 --> 18:47.900
Use Chiga to do... what?

18:48.740 --> 18:50.320
TO JERK OFF!

18:50.530 --> 18:53.950
I can't believe I'm thinking about this, I'm such a huge perv!

18:56.130 --> 18:59.370
A-Anyways, I'll just grab a drink of water and cool down...

19:06.570 --> 19:07.510
Kokusai-san?

19:15.310 --> 19:16.260
Chiga!

19:17.000 --> 19:19.730
I decided I don't want tea, I want noodles!

19:20.660 --> 19:22.230
Why am I hiding..?

19:22.790 --> 19:28.110
By the way, Chiga, I was thinking seriously
about what you said before...

19:29.110 --> 19:33.160
and maybe this is the first time you've
actually been in love with someone.

19:33.820 --> 19:34.410
Wha...?!

19:35.530 --> 19:37.720
Say one more word and I'll kill you!

19:37.870 --> 19:39.400
Say the name and I'll kill you!

19:39.440 --> 19:41.540
Huh? Why? What's the big deal?

19:41.790 --> 19:43.400
I will <i>kill</i> you.

19:43.480 --> 19:47.090
Come on, relax! I'm not trying to tease you.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.660
It's just funny!

19:48.790 --> 19:52.510
I-Isn't that called teasing?

19:52.610 --> 19:56.810
No, no, no! The funny part is your reaction.

19:57.050 --> 20:01.530
Weren't you always the guy that would share girls
with us after you'd hooked up with them?

20:01.770 --> 20:03.310
Please stop it...

20:03.740 --> 20:05.190
Kokusai-san's still here...

20:05.440 --> 20:09.350
God, is it because I've been a bad boy?

20:09.690 --> 20:11.550
And now you're all...

20:11.700 --> 20:13.740
never do anything like that again!

20:14.110 --> 20:15.370
Never again!

20:16.090 --> 20:18.450
He's like the guy all other guys aspire to.

20:18.700 --> 20:20.750
But... that's pretty low.

20:21.740 --> 20:23.670
What's wrong, man?

20:24.610 --> 20:27.290
I was too mentally immature,

20:28.130 --> 20:30.920
that's why I was able to disregard other people's
feelings and play around like that.

20:31.530 --> 20:33.800
I would never do that again... ever!

20:34.890 --> 20:38.390
So Chiga changed because he fell in love with that girl...

20:39.010 --> 20:44.560
Here I am getting hot and bothered with perverted fantasies,
while my underclassman is maturing as a human being.

20:44.870 --> 20:46.900
God, I'm pathetic...

20:47.090 --> 20:49.690
No more pervy fantasizing!

20:50.000 --> 20:51.320
Self-control, self-control!

21:00.010 --> 21:02.530
I-I'm avoiding him...

21:03.350 --> 21:04.920
Kokusai, what's wrong with you?

21:05.130 --> 21:06.920
Oh, I'm just a little...

21:07.500 --> 21:10.670
I mean, every time I look at Chiga I get all horny..

21:10.920 --> 21:13.310
Kokusai! Chiga, one of the freshmen, is calling for you!

21:15.140 --> 21:17.800
Oh, no! I'm not emotionally prepared yet...

21:18.740 --> 21:21.140
Kokusai says he's not feeling well.

21:21.790 --> 21:24.980
Oh... Well, I didn't really have anything in particular to say.

21:25.440 --> 21:27.610
Why is he avoiding me all of a sudden?

21:27.920 --> 21:30.570
Have I done something that would make him avoid me?

21:30.940 --> 21:33.820
